  "question": {
    "text": "A refrigerator consumes an average <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi></math> power to operate between temperature <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. If there is no loss of energy then how much average heat per second does it transfer?"
  },
